        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/be51efb1585d90611c49315f4ad1bda2.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Apartment is a bizarre building controlled by the Clown Evil God. It contains an almost endless space, a variety of strange rooms, and an unceasing stream of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend has it that a way to fulfill any wish can be found in Fallen Apartment. However, most people who enter this mansion lose their souls and become the Evil God's playthings for all eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, our heroines have not easily surrendered to the Evil God. They still have the chance to face the Evil God directly and defeat him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ A bizarre and fantastical storyline with over 25 exquisite, fully animated CG sequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Three fully animated character portraits featuring multiple layers of clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Dozens of relics and weapons with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Six branching endings and New Game Plus functionality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/abdae02b97548fb279586019a392b3e7.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/bbab9100fba101ec0afc448880b19fe4.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/0b423fa0d50e427886147a5bda9d5879.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/b1767e67c3d5cd1554b1201dc7941c6e.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/b1767e67c3d5cd1554b1201dc7941c6e.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/bfe5a875646f017829e012c0b81dc87b.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Play as a charming heroine and immerse yourself in the top-down shooter world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/851a1ff6fdcc0327fb802f343066d279.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Light roguelike random levels—each run offers a brand-new experience, letting you easily enjoy the adventure intertwined with strategy and gunfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/352cbb1c5a806e4c15e9370e521f8145.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Dozens of bizarre events await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/3ae8e70d8dacb154a321201498548b74.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Purchase and upgrade your weapons at the mysterious shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/826385a8dcea174b0f49664f97fc724e.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Challenge a variety of powerful bosses.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/be51efb1585d90611c49315f4ad1bda2.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/27482f1b5f6919741aa37596b2250897.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Apartment is a bizarre building controlled by the Clown Evil God. It contains an almost endless space, a variety of strange rooms, and an unceasing stream of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend has it that a way to fulfill any wish can be found in Fallen Apartment. However, most people who enter this mansion lose their souls and become the Evil God's playthings for all eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, our heroines have not easily surrendered to the Evil God. They still have the chance to face the Evil God directly and defeat him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ A bizarre and fantastical storyline with over 25 exquisite, fully animated CG sequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Three fully animated character portraits featuring multiple layers of clothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Dozens of relics and weapons with unique abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Six branching endings and New Game Plus functionality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/9ffc83c6bc7eb9c03b29a8bd4fd6ae17.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/abdae02b97548fb279586019a392b3e7.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/bbab9100fba101ec0afc448880b19fe4.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/0b423fa0d50e427886147a5bda9d5879.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/b1767e67c3d5cd1554b1201dc7941c6e.avif?t=1788524501\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras_big/b1767e67c3d5cd1554b1201dc7941c6e.webp?t=1788524501 width=1560 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/bfe5a875646f017829e012c0b81dc87b.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Play as a charming heroine and immerse yourself in the top-down shooter world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/851a1ff6fdcc0327fb802f343066d279.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Light roguelike random levels—each run offers a brand-new experience, letting you easily enjoy the adventure intertwined with strategy and gunfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/352cbb1c5a806e4c15e9370e521f8145.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Dozens of bizarre events await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/3ae8e70d8dacb154a321201498548b74.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Purchase and upgrade your weapons at the mysterious shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347620/extras/826385a8dcea174b0f49664f97fc724e.avif?t=1788524501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Challenge a variety of powerful bosses.</p>",
